# The backend image is built from the repository root and copies two folders by name
# (see first_issue_graphrag/backend/Dockerfile). Everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!first_issue_graphrag/
first_issue_graphrag/*
!first_issue_graphrag/*.py
!first_issue_graphrag/backend/
first_issue_graphrag/backend/*
!first_issue_graphrag/backend/requirements.txt
!first_issue_graphrag/backend/app/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
